  "body": "- Add `apachectl` command parser\r\n- Add `ics` file parser\r\n- Add `conntrack` command parser\r\n- Add `nfsiostat` command parser\r\n- Add `nfsiostat-s` streaming command parser\r\n- Add `nftables` `nft` command parser\r\n- Fix `cksum` parser for lines with no filename\r\n- Fix `crontab` and `crontab_u` parsers to ignore whitespace-only lines\r\n- Fix `dpkg` parser for Unicode table header\r\n- Fix `fstab` parser to ignore whitespace-only lines\r\n- Fix `group` parser to ignore whitespace-only lines\r\n- Fix `gshadow` parser to ignore whitespace-only lines\r\n- Fix `ipconfig` parser to not warn for incompatibility on Windows\r\n- Fix `lsattr` parser to support e2fsprogs and support `x` and `m` flags\r\n- Fix `passwd` parser to ignore whitespace-only lines\r\n- Fix `plist` parser for deprecation warning for codecs.open()\r\n- Fix `shadow` parser to ignore whitespace-only lines\r\n- Binary builds for linux and macOS (x86_64 and ARM) now include the\r\n  python 3.14 runtime. Those executable files are now significantly smaller.\r\n  Windows builds still use python 3.10 runtime",
